  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9876f83510731f4d97169c0d46b0606, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lucifer Greetings - DialogueLine 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: " I know it\u2019s hard at the beginning, but you have infinite
      lives. And I\u2019ll always be here. I guess that sounded too romantic."
    portugueseLine: "Sei que \xE9 dif\xEDcil no come\xE7o, mas voc\xEA tem vidas
      infinitas. E eu estarei sempre aqui. Acho que isso soou romantico demais. "
    chineseLine: "\u6211\u77E5\u9053\u4E00\u5F00\u59CB\u5F88\u96BE\uFF0C\u4F46\u4F60\u6709\u65E0\u9650\u751F\u547D\u3002\u6211\u4E00\u76F4\u90FD\u5728\u3002\u6211\u60F3\u8FD9\u542C\u8D77\u6765\u592A\u6D6A\u6F2B\u4E86\u3002"
    spanishLine: " S\xE9 que al principio es dif\xEDcil, pero tienes vidas infinitas.
      Y siempre estar\xE9 aqu\xED. Creo que eso son\xF3 demasiado rom\xE1ntico."
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: " You\u2019re weird... "
    portugueseLine: "Voc\xEA \xE9 estranho..."
    chineseLine: "\u4F60\u771F\u5947\u602A... "
    spanishLine: " Eres extra\xF1o... "
